    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1174736084}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2170092730045470124, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SubTitles
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1686819858}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SubTitles
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1686819858}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpAudio.Array.size
      value: 38
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpAudio.Array.data[37]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22f8e0131dd31e74283db83c05f68d5e, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.size
      value: 38
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[6]
      value: Yup, that propeller is cracked, it wont work, take it off the wind sensor.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[8]
      value: "Great! Now pop it on the wind sensor and we\u2019ll see if it\u2019s
        a match."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[9]
      value: Use the test button in front of the wind sensor to test it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[10]
      value: Hmm.  You need to try a different size propeller.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[11]
      value: Pick up the wind sensor and place it in the sled
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[12]
      value: "Put me in the sled and let\u2019s repair that station! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[13]
      value: Put the wind sensor back on the tower and we should be good to go!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[14]
      value: Press the button below the map to test the tower.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[15]
      value: Use the modules from the left panel to complete the data pathways in
        the right pane
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[16]
      value: Put the sensor and battery box in the sled.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[17]
      value: Put me in the sled
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[18]
      value: Put me in the sled
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[19]
      value: "Let\u2019s fix the data logger, complete the data sequence on the right
        using the correct circuits."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[20]
      value: "Let\u2019s start by aligning the solar panel to face the sun."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[21]
      value: All of this broken stuff needs to come inside, Put the battery box,
        wind sensor, and snow sensor in the sled
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[22]
      value: Now put me in the sled!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[23]
      value: "That equipment won\u2019t fix itself just sitting in the sled, You\u2019ve
        got to take it out onto your workbench."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[24]
      value: We need to craft a new battery, check your inventory for a baseplate.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[25]
      value: It looks like this would supply the wrong amount of power, try a different
        one
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[26]
      value: "We need to add cells, that\u2019s in your inventory as well."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[27]
      value: The battery is fixed! Pop it in the sled.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[28]
      value: Get rid of the bad propeller and replace it with a good one from your
        inventory
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[29]
      value: The wind sensor is done, pop it in the sled
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[30]
      value: "Hmm, that\u2019s the wrong size prop, try a different one."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[31]
      value: Press the buttons on the dock to calibrate the temperature sensor
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[32]
      value: The temperature sensor is almost calibrated! You just need to complete
        the sequence
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[33]
      value: Put me in the sled.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[34]
      value: Place all the fixed equipment back on the tower.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[35]
      value: "Put me in the sled, let\u2019s test the connection!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[36]
      value: "Press the uplink button, the suspense is killing me!... Well, not really,
        I\u2019m not alive. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_ArgoHelpSubtitles.Array.data[37]
      value: Now we just need to put the battery and the sensor back on the tower.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2381288934619916014, guid: c516ba457aa298444966363a0717980d,
        type: 3}
